        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Judge Doom, Christopher Lloyd, Uncle Fester, Jackie Coogan\n- Works: Who Framed Roger Rabbit, The Addams Family television series\n- Roles: Judge Doom, Uncle Fester\n\nFacts:\n- Jackie Coogan played an Addams Family character in the original television series The Addams Family.\n- Christopher Lloyd played the same Addams Family character, Uncle Fester, in later Addams Family films.\n- Christopher Lloyd played Judge Doom in Who Framed Roger Rabbit.\n- Therefore, Judge Doom is the role in Who Framed Roger Rabbit played by Christopher Lloyd, the actor associated with the Addams Family character Uncle Fester previously played by Jackie Coogan.",
