        "original_id": "d064a26b-5ea3-5439-9274-f9e7dccb9853",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Uncle Fester, Jackie Coogan, Christopher Lloyd, Patrick Thomas\n- Works: The Addams Family, Addams Family Values, Addams Family Reunion, original television series, two feature films\n\nFacts:\n- Jackie Coogan played Uncle Fester in the original television series.\n- Christopher Lloyd was born on October 22, 1938, and he is an American actor, voice actor, and comedian.\n- Christopher Lloyd played Uncle Fester in The Addams Family (1991).\n- Christopher Lloyd played Uncle Fester again in Addams Family Values (1993).\n- Patrick Thomas played Uncle Fester in the direct-to-video film Addams Family Reunion.\n- Christopher Lloyd is also known for playing Emmett \"Doc\" Brown in the Back to the Future trilogy, Judge Doom in Who Framed Roger Rabbit (1988), Merlock the Magician in a 1990 film, and Grigori Rasputin in Anastasia (1997).",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
