        "text": "Page: Uncle Fester. Sentence: He was played by Jackie Coogan in the original television series, by Christopher Lloyd in the two feature films, and by Patrick Thomas in the direct-for-video film \"Addams Family Reunion\".\nPage: Christopher Lloyd. Sentence: Christopher Allen Lloyd (born October 22, 1938) is an American actor, voice actor and comedian best known for his roles as Emmett \"Doc\" Brown in the \"Back to the Future\" trilogy, Judge Doom in \"Who Framed Roger Rabbit\" (1988), Merlock the Magician in \"\" (1990), Uncle Fester in \"The Addams Family\" (1991) and its sequel \"Addams Family Values\" (1993), and Grigori Rasputin in \"Anastasia\" (1997).",
